...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

ui: "화면" { class: ours }
runtime: "런타임" { class: ours }
server: "서버" { class: ours }
agent: "코디네이터" { class: ours }
openai: "OpenAI gpt-5.5" { class: ext }

agent -> openai: 모델 호출 (요약 담음)
openai -> agent: write_file 호출
agent -> server: TOOL_CALL (write_file)
server -> runtime: SSE 이벤트
runtime -> ui: 카드 · 파일 목록
agent -> server: TOOL_CALL_RESULT
